    { "f": 146.520, "n": "2 m Simplex Calling", "z": "2 米直通呼叫", "c": "ham", "m": "FM", "conf": "std", "a": "Simplex", "d": "The worst terrain on this site, and the most rewarding. From Mount Washington you cover the whole point; from the Mon Valley floor you cover almost nothing.", "dz": "本站地形最差、也最有回报的地方。在华盛顿山上能覆盖整个三角洲；在蒙河谷底几乎什么都覆盖不了。", "odds": 1 },
    { "f": 146.700, "n": "2 m repeater outputs — scan 145.110–147.390", "z": "2 米中继下行 · 扫 145.110–147.390", "c": "ham", "m": "FM", "conf": "check", "a": "Repeaters", "d": "Repeater siting here is genuinely skilled work and the good machines are on the high ridges. In a valley, find one that reaches you and keep it.", "dz": "这里的中继选址是真功夫，好机器都在高脊上。在谷里，找到一台能覆盖你的就守住它。", "odds": 1 },
